<script type="text/javascript">
    
	$(document).ready(function () {
		var logConsole = function (str) {
			console.log(str);
		};
		if ($('#tabPortlet_539233 .divTabEdit').val() == "True") {
			var isModern = ('True');
			if (isModern.toLowerCase() == "true") {
				var tabObj = $('#tabPortlet_539233 ');
				var tabM = $('#ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl20_divTabs').attr('portlet') == 'tab';

				function activate() {
					$(tabObj).scrollingTabs({
						tabs: [{"paneId":"ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl20_divTabs_0","title":"2022 By-Trustee Area Elections Redistricting","content":"<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">By-Trustee Area Elections Redistricting</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>Based on 2020 Census data, school districts with trustee area systems were required to review and, if necessary, adjust their trustee area map by March 1, 2022, to ensure population balance. This applied to CUSD, which transitioned to a by-trustee area election system in 2019 to ensure compliance with the California Voting Rights Act or \"CVRA\". Please refer to the timeline below:</p>\n<p><strong>April 4, 2022</strong> &ndash; The San Mateo County Committee on School Organization reviewed <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pxe2tEfXsybXsNLpYC0x5T6wwiloyAPV/view?usp=sharing\" title=\"Link\">CUSD's adopted Trustee Area Map</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>February 10, 2022 </strong>- The Governing Board received information from Tom Williams of Enrollment Projection Consultants on the status of and recommendations for redistricting, held a <a href=\"https://app.eduportal.com/documents/view/822275\" title=\"Link\">Public Hearing</a> to receive and consider input regarding the composition of trustee area maps to be used in the adjustment of trustee area boundaries, and approved the proposed&nbsp;<a href=\"https://app.eduportal.com/documents/view/822272\" title=\"Link\">Trustee Area Map Alternative 6</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>January 20, 2022&nbsp;</strong>&ndash;&nbsp;&nbsp;Demographer Thomas Williams of Enrollment Projection Consultants presented the CUSD Governing Board <a href=\"https://app.eduportal.com/documents/view/820282\" title=\"Link\">six potential alternative maps</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>December 14, 2021&nbsp;</strong>&ndash;&nbsp; The Governing Board received information on the impact of the 2020 Census Data on Trustee Area Map Population Balance. Demographer Thomas Williams of Enrollment Projection Consultants presented <a href=\"https://app.eduportal.com/documents/view/817344\" title=\"Link\">preliminary findings and four alternative maps</a> with adjusted Trustee Area boundary lines to balance population across each area to within the permissible 10% variance.</p>","active":false,"disabled":false},{"paneId":"ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_ctl20_divTabs_1","title":"2019 Transition to By-Trustee Area Election System","content":"<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">Transition to By-Trustee Area Election System<br>\n</span></strong><br>\n<strong>June 3, 2019</strong> &ndash; The San Mateo County Committee on School Organization took action to approve the proposal from the Cabrillo Unified School District Board to establish trustee areas within the Cabrillo Unified School District and to transition to a by-trustee area voting process.<br>\n<br>\n<strong>April 8, 2019</strong> &ndash; The Governing Board adopted the Resolution 02-19 establishing and implementing the Trustee Area District Election for Board Members, and authorized the District to transmit this resolution and the final trustee area plan adopted (<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KJfXnnOCQ0FfHMXOFyKkjZHE5mG6i_07/view\" title=\"Link\">the Orange map</a>) to the San Mateo County Committee to complete the District's transition to a by-trustee area election system for the 2020 Governing Board elections.<br>\n<br>\n<strong>March 26, 2019 </strong>&ndash; A fourth draft map, (<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KJfXnnOCQ0FfHMXOFyKkjZHE5mG6i_07/view\" title=\"Link\">the Orange map</a>) was posted online and available at the District Office.<br>\n<br>\n<strong>March 14, 2019</strong> &ndash; The Board held its fourth open hearing to solicit and provide input regarding the composition of the potential trustee area draft maps, including reviewing a third draft map, (<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/a/cabrillo.k12.ca.us/file/d/1g_TmoGRWHMOdnTSodNNprz3pWAwxLmWo/view?usp=sharing\" title=\"Link\">the Purple map</a>) prepared by the demographer.<br>\n<br>\n<strong>February 13, 2019</strong> &ndash;&nbsp; The Board held its third open hearing to solicit and provide input regarding the composition of the potential trustee area draft maps, including reviewing two draft maps, (the <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/a/cabrillo.k12.ca.us/file/d/1dUoyFD1sBEHbEZ2un8RDzS2rvhzmQyYm/view?usp=sharing\" title=\"Link\">Green</a> and <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/a/cabrillo.k12.ca.us/file/d/1hyur-T_qMIhbsBea_K65qOzstcHtABzw/view?usp=sharing\" title=\"Link\">Yellow</a> maps) prepared by the demographer.<br>\n<br>\n<strong>November 14, 2018</strong> &ndash; The Board held its second open hearing to solicit and provide input regarding the composition of the potential trustee area draft maps.<br>\n<br>\n<strong>November 5, 2018 </strong>&ndash;&nbsp; The Governing Board held its first open hearing to solicit and provide input regarding the composition of the potential trustee area draft maps.<br>\n<br>\n<strong>October 11, 2018</strong> &ndash; The Board voted to approve the proposal to initiate the process for the District to transition from an &ldquo;At-Large&rdquo; election system to a &ldquo;By-Trustee Area&rdquo; election system commencing with the 2020 Board elections.<br>\n<br>\n<strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">Drafts</span></strong><br>\n<br>\nProposed Map <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/a/cabrillo.k12.ca.us/file/d/1dUoyFD1sBEHbEZ2un8RDzS2rvhzmQyYm/view?usp=sharing\" title=\"Link\">Green</a><br>\nProposed Map <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/a/cabrillo.k12.ca.us/file/d/1hyur-T_qMIhbsBea_K65qOzstcHtABzw/view?usp=sharing\" title=\"Link\">Yellow</a><br>\nProposed Map <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/a/cabrillo.k12.ca.us/file/d/1g_TmoGRWHMOdnTSodNNprz3pWAwxLmWo/view?usp=sharing\" title=\"Link\">Purple</a><br>\nProposed Map <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/a/cabrillo.k12.ca.us/file/d/1KJfXnnOCQ0FfHMXOFyKkjZHE5mG6i_07/view?usp=sharing\" title=\"Link\">Orange</a><br>\nInteractive Review <a href=\"https://ndcresearch.maps.arcgis.com/apps/View/index.html?appid=f41e857c7f6444cbb1f5e9f0a1197293\" title=\"Link\">Map</a></p>","active":false,"disabled":false}],// required,
						propPaneId: 'paneId', // optional - pass in default value for demo purposes
						propTitle: 'title', // optional - pass in default value for demo purposes
						propActive: 'active', // optional - pass in default value for demo purposes
						propDisabled: 'disabled', // optional - pass in default value for demo purposes
						propContent: 'content', // optional - pass in default value for demo purposes
						tabMode: tabM,
						scrollToTabEdge: false, // optional - pass in default value for demo purposes
						disableScrollArrowsOnFullyScrolled: false // optional- pass in default value for demo purposes
					}).on('ready.scrtabs', function () {
						$('#' + this.id + ' .tab-pane').attr('tabindex', 0);
					});
				};

				activate();

            }
        }
	});

    function OnClientLoad(editor) {
        editor.attachEventHandler('onkeydown', function () { detectChanges(); });  
    }

    function OnCommandExecuted(editor) {
        detectChanges();
    }

    function OnTabNameChanged() {
        detectChanges();
    }

    function detectChanges() {
        var unsavedChanges = $('.unsaved-changes-row input[type=hidden]');
        if (unsavedChanges.length > 0) {
            unsavedChanges.val('True');
        }
    }
</script>
